_:genid103 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
_:genid104 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
